  "id": "assertion",
  "term": "assertion",
  "definition": "Assertion is the ability to state one’s needs, preferences, and opinions in social situations while staying engaged with other people. It is a socially grounded way of expressing oneself that differs from aggression, which puts the self above others, and from passivity, which hides or suppresses one’s own needs.",
